    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>tanx</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Substituting,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mf